      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img&#xA;    src=&#34;../images/pfp.png&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;Profile Image&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;  /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption&gt;Profile Image&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img&#xA;    src=&#34;../images/test-3.webp&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;Test Image&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;  /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption&gt;Test Image&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Server-side engineer based in Tokyo. Lover of mirth and gaiety.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My focus is on distributed systems, multiplayer networking, and cloud infrastructure. I primarily work with Go, C, Kubernetes, and Terraform.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I studied Computer Science and Japanese at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.swarthmore.edu/&#34;&gt;Swarthmore College&lt;/a&gt;, and spent time studying at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/&#34;&gt;The University of Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;. During my time at Swarthmore, I worked as a project manager and was on the board of the &lt;a href=&#34;https://sccs.swarthmore.edu&#34;&gt;Swarthmore College Computer Society (SCCS)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
